      "length": 20,
      "addedAt": "2026-07-25T07:16:03.530Z"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "content": "上課的時候同桌給我寫了張紙條。“在嗎” ",
      "length": 20,
      "addedAt": "2026-07-25T07:16:03.530Z"
    },
    {
